### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me

### Register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Citizen",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "role": "citizen"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gov.in",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Get Complaints
GET http://localhost:5000/api/complaints
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Submit Complaint
POST http://localhost:5000/api/complaints
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Water pipe burst on Main Street",
  "description": "Large water pipe burst near Zone 2 Main Street junction. Water flooding the road.",
  "category": "water",
  "location": {
    "address": "Main Street, Zone 2",
    "lat": 13.0827,
    "lng": 80.2707,
    "zone": "Zone 2"
  }
}

### AI Classify
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/classify
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pothole on highway",
  "description": "Large pothole on NH-48 near Zone 3 flyover causing accidents"
}

### IoT Simulate
POST http://localhost:5000/api/iot/simulate
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### AI Chat
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What are the top complaint areas this week?",
  "context": "Government AI OS official chatbot"
}
